{"version":1,"content":"<p>集結視帝陳豪、馬國明、陳展鵬及視后楊茜堯與林夏薇主演的無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》在內地平台已播出大結局，隨即引起討論，更有網民將楊茜堯長達7分鐘的結局重頭戲上載至社交網，更爆出劇中除了早已遇害的陳自瑤外，陳豪、姚子羚及鄺潔楹亦不得善終！</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:17:12.515354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.609990+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.609990+00:00","content_hash":"ace200db84b383c761e74d98bc8b3f4741b91dbeb86c546dcf289a5fb4b373db","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}